WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.480
SCP-682 Vs SCP-1056.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.600
Could this anomalous, body-warping kitchen
timer finally be the thing that shrinks SCP-682

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.480
down to size?

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.520
Let’s find out.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:16.720
The objective of the test was to see how long
it would take SCP-682 to return to its normal

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.800
size after being resized by SCP-1056.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.800
However, when the creature was meant to be
shrunk to a quarter of its size, it simply

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.600
disappeared.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.800
It was later found causing chaos outside of
Site-19, having returned to its normal size.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:36.240
When a Mobile Task Force was sent to apprehend
682, it released a wave that instead massively

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.600
shrunk the task force.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:42.400
It continued to rampage elsewhere, manipulating
its size at will, until a combined group of

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.360
Mobile Task Forces were able to incapacitate
it.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:51.120
Researchers concluded that it had not only
absorbed the anomalous effect of SCP-1056,

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:57.200
but enhanced it, leading to considerably more
powerful defensive and offensive body-resizing

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.400
capabilities.

